              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Daudi nasunjila Yoabu nende abandu bosi aba yali ninabo, mbu Randule tsingubo tsieenywe, mwibohe tsingubo tsiamakunia, mumwikhuule Abineri. Naye omuruchi Daudi nalonda inyuma weshitalatalilo shiomulambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
